@host = http://localhost:8020
@runId = replace-with-run-id

###
# 1. 信息不足追问：预期返回 NEED_MORE_INFO / questions
POST {{host}}/api/tickets/agent-runs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "demo-need-info",
  "userId": "u-demo",
  "content": "接口报错了",
  "source": "WEB"
}

###
# 2. 完整故障分析：复制响应里的 runId 到上面的 @runId
POST {{host}}/api/tickets/agent-runs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": "demo-incident",
  "userId": "u-demo",
  "content": "生产环境 payment-service Pod OOMKilled，从上午 10 点开始多个用户支付失败，内存使用从 200Mi 飙升到 512Mi 后被 kill，错误为 java.lang.OutOfMemoryError: Java heap space",
  "source": "WEB"
}

###
# 3. 审计步骤：查看 Agent 执行链路
GET {{host}}/api/audit/agent-runs/{{runId}}

###
# 4. LLM 调用统计：查看单个 run 调了几次 LLM、耗时、失败/fallback、token
GET {{host}}/api/audit/agent-runs/{{runId}}/llm-stats

###
# 5. Eval：查看 total/passed/failed/failureByAssertion/caseResults
POST {{host}}/api/evals/run

###
# 5.1 Eval：导出页面/客户端已持有的 EvalReport，不会重新运行 case
# POST {{host}}/api/evals/export
# Content-Type: application/json
#
# {
#   "report": { "粘贴 /api/evals/run 或 /api/evals/run-case 返回的完整 JSON" },
#   "outputPath": "data/eval/reports/current-eval.json"
# }

###
# 5.2 Eval：单 case 运行，仅返回结果；如需导出，在页面点击“导出当前结果”
POST {{host}}/api/evals/run-case?caseId=intermittent-slow-followup

###
# 6. Prometheus 指标：搜索 agent_run_total / llm_call_total / tool_call_total / rag_hit_total / fallback_total
GET {{host}}/actuator/prometheus

###
# 7. 单独查看最小业务指标
GET {{host}}/actuator/metrics/agent_run_total

###
GET {{host}}/actuator/metrics/llm_call_total

###
GET {{host}}/actuator/metrics/tool_call_total

###
GET {{host}}/actuator/metrics/rag_hit_total

###
GET {{host}}/actuator/metrics/fallback_total
